+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id for password hashing. It was chosen because it is memory-hard and timing-resistant by design, which makes it more resistant to GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks. No parameter values (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
